  <Thumbnail>b40beb6c-12a0-4a28-ac99-c0dd7242744f</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="22-04-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Created from Robe_Robin 300E Spot.d4" />
  <History Date="09-06-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Total rewrite of Gobo2Func, Gobo2 and Gobo2Rot." />
  <History Date="05-07-10" Author="Jonathan Moreton" Comment="Fixed Negative number on Gobo 1 DMX Range" />
  <History Date="01-09-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Tested against fixture, remaned a few functions." />
  <History Date="19-07-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Inverted Hotspot in response to Robe." />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information. Added RDM Fixture information. Added RDM Mode information." />
  <History Date="19-11-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed hotspot locate to 50 pc in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="10-01-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed PT Speed update from control.  Standardised conditionals.  Fixed 16bit raw ranges." />
  <History Date="10-01-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution." />
  <History Date="29-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches.  Added physical pan/tilt ranges.  Overhauled." />
